{"ref":"BDB, עָרוֹד","hw":"עָרוֹד","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עָרוֹד</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>wild ass (</strong>prob. Aramaic loan-word (= Heb. <span dir=\"rtl\">פֶּרֶא</span>), 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲרָדָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲרוֹדָא</span>; Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܥܪܳܕܳܐ</span>; Mand. <span dir=\"rtl\">אראדא</span>, cf. Hom<sup>NS 133</sup><strong>)</strong>* <a data-ref=\"Job 39:5\" href=\"/Job.39.5\">Jb 39:5</a>.","next":"BDB, עָרַךְ","prev":"BDB, תַּ֫עַר"}